# Exclude everything by default
*

# Include only the essential files needed for building the library
!Zitadel.Client.sln
!src/

# The analyzer severities live in the root .editorconfig. Without it the
# container build runs analysers with their default severities and, since the
# generated sources carry no `// <auto-generated/>` header, turns each finding
# into an error. Let it into the build context so the container sees the same
# analyzer config as a local build.
!.editorconfig
